{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-miku",
  "id": "source-16592",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16592001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "歌唱吧，起舞吧，雀跃吧！\n在这个繁花盛开的季节~♫",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "曾经空荡荡的剧场，被台下观众们的窃窃私语逐渐填满。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "现场座无虚席，就连走道里也被手持荧光棒的观众们所占据。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592004",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "这是属于春天的舞台，这是属于少女的舞台。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "轮到我们出场了呢，大家有好好的看着我吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我，紧张到双手忍不住颤抖……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "没问题的，优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "我们大家排练了那么久，是时候让所有的观众见证我们的努力了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，毕竟那么辛苦才换来了今天……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "终于，来到了这个舞台，一起深呼吸吧——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "3",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "2",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "1——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "奏响吧，未来之音！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "起舞吧，在这百花盛开的春天~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "跳跃吧，在这万物新生的春天。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "旋转吧，在这繁花似锦的春天。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "我能听到你心底的音乐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "如果感到失落，就躲进我的歌声里吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "初音未来",
          "text": "来，跟我一起吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592022",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "你看到了吗，我的主人|101|？",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592023",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "这是我们为你而颂唱的「春天」的歌声，其名为——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16592024",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "「万物繁花梦之歌」♫",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
